        "description": "<p>Allows users of your site to set custom profile pics from the local media library.</p>\n<p>Set a profile pic under: <em>Users &gt; Profile &gt; Profile Picture &gt; Select Profile Pic</em></p>\n",
        "installation": "<p><strong>Automatic</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>From your WordPress Admin, navigate to: <em>Plugins &gt; Add New</em></li>\n<li>Search for: &#8220;Profile Pics&#8221;</li>\n<li>Install it</li>\n<li>Activate it</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>Manual</strong></p>\n<ul>\n<li>Download</li>\n<li>Unzip</li>\n<li>Upload to <em>/plugins</em> folder</li>\n<li>Activate</li>\n</ul>\n",
